#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:3
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Suiteáil"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:6
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Íoslódáil"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can download the latest version of the Nextcloud Desktop Synchronization"
" Client from the `Nextcloud download page`_. Clients are available for "
"Linux, macOS, and Microsoft Windows."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir an leagan is déanaí de Chliant Sioncronaithe Deisce Nextcloud a "
"íoslódáil ó `leathanach íoslódála Nextcloud`_. Tá cliantanna ar fáil do "
"Linux, macOS, agus Microsoft Windows."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:12
msgid ""
"You will also find links to source code archives and older versions on the "
"download page."
msgstr ""
"Gheobhaidh tú naisc freisin chuig cartlanna cód foinse agus leaganacha níos "
"sine ar an leathanach íoslódála."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:16
msgid "Supported server versions"
msgstr "Leaganacha freastalaí tacaithe"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:18
msgid ""
"Each desktop client release supports the latest three stable Nextcloud "
"server major versions at the time of release. See the `Nextcloud Server "
"release schedule`_ for supported major versions."
msgstr ""
"Tacaíonn gach eisiúint den chliant deisce leis na trí leagan mór is déanaí "
"de fhreastalaí Nextcloud atá cobhsaí tráth na heisiúna. Féach ar `sceideal "
"eisiúna fhreastalaí Nextcloud`_ chun na leaganacha móra a dtacaítear leo a "
"fheiceáil."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:23
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "Riachtanais Chórais"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:25
msgid "Windows 10+ (64-bits only)"
msgstr "Windows 10+ (64-giotán amháin)"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:26
msgid "macOS 12.0+ (64-bits only)"
msgstr "macOS 12.0+ (64-giotán amháin)"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:27
msgid "Linux (Ubuntu 24.04 or openSUSE 15.5 or Alma 8 or ...) (64-bits only)"
msgstr ""
"Linux (Ubuntu 24.04 nó openSUSE 15.5 nó Alma 8 nó ...) (64-giotán amháin)"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:29
msgid ""
"For Linux distributions, we support, if technically feasible, the current "
"LTS releases. For BSD, we support them if technically feasible, but we do "
"not test them."
msgstr ""
"I gcás dáileacháin Linux, tacaímid leis na leaganacha LTS reatha, má tá sé "
"sin indéanta go teicniúil. I gcás BSD, tacaímid leo má tá sé sin indéanta go"
" teicniúil, ach ní dhéanaimid tástáil orthu."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:34
msgid "We do not support Citrix."
msgstr "Ní thacaímid le Citrix."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:36
msgid ""
"We will do our best to advise Citrix users from the desktop client point of "
"view."
msgstr ""
"Déanfaimid ár ndícheall comhairle a chur ar úsáideoirí Citrix ó thaobh an "
"chliaint deisce de."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:37
msgid ""
"We will fix issues that are also reproducible on the standard supported "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Deiseoidh muid fadhbanna is féidir a atáirgeadh ar na córais chaighdeánacha "
"a dtacaítear leo freisin."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:38
msgid "Everything else is outside of our scope."
msgstr "Tá gach rud eile lasmuigh dár raon feidhme."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:41
msgid "Install on macOS and Windows"
msgstr "Suiteáil ar macOS agus Windows"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:43
msgid ""
"Installation on macOS and Windows is the same as for any other software "
"application: download the program and then double-click it to launch the "
"installation, and then follow the installation wizard. After it is installed"
" and configured the desktop client will automatically keep itself updated; "
"see :doc:`autoupdate` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Tá an tsuiteáil ar macOS agus Windows mar an gcéanna le haon fheidhmchlár "
"bogearraí eile: íoslódáil an clár, cliceáil faoi dhó air chun an tsuiteáil a"
" thosú, agus lean treoracha an draoi suiteála. Nuair a bheidh sé suiteáilte "
"agus cumraithe, coinneoidh an cliant deisce é féin cothrom le dáta go "
"huathoibríoch; féach :doc:`autoupdate` chun tuilleadh eolais a fháil."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:49
msgid ""
"For administrator-focused deployment options such as advanced Windows MSI "
"configuration, non-interactive account provisioning, and command-line wizard"
" preconfiguration, see the Admin Manual chapter on desktop client deployment"
" and setup."
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh roghanna imlonnaithe atá dírithe ar riarthóirí — mar shampla "
"cumraíocht ardleibhéil Windows MSI, soláthar cuntas neamh-idirghníomhach, "
"agus réamhchumraíocht trí dhraoi líne-ordaithe — féach an chaibidil sa "
"Lámhleabhar Riarthóra a bhaineann le himlonnú agus socrú an chliaint deisce."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:55
msgid "Install on Linux"
msgstr "Suiteáil ar Linux"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:57
msgid ""
"For Linux, Nextcloud officially provides the desktop client as an AppImage "
"on the `Nextcloud download page`_."
msgstr ""
"I gcás Linux, cuireann Nextcloud an cliant deisce ar fáil go hoifigiúil mar "
"AppImage ar `leathanach íoslódála Nextcloud`_."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:60
msgid ""
"Some Linux distributions also provide the Nextcloud desktop client through "
"their package managers. These packages are maintained by the distribution or"
" community, not by Nextcloud. If you prefer a package-managed installation, "
"refer to your distribution's documentation."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann roinnt dáileachán Linux cliant deisce Nextcloud ar fáil freisin "
"trína mbainisteoirí pacáistí. Is iad an dáileachán nó an pobal a choinníonn "
"na pacáistí seo, ní Nextcloud. Má bhíonn tú ag iarraidh an bogearra a "
"shuiteáil trí bhainisteoir pacáistí, féach ar dhoiciméadúchán do "
"dháileacháin."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:65
msgid ""
"Linux users must also have a password manager enabled, such as GNOME Keyring"
" or KWallet, so that the desktop client can log in automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ní mór d’úsáideoirí Linux bainisteoir pasfhocal a bheith cumasaithe acu "
"freisin, ar nós GNOME Keyring nó KWallet, ionas gur féidir leis an gcliant "
"deisce logáil isteach go huathoibríoch."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:69
msgid "Initial setup"
msgstr "Socrú tosaigh"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:71
msgid ""
"After installation, the setup wizard opens. Enter the address you use to "
"access your Nextcloud server in a browser, then click **Log in**."
msgstr ""
"Tar éis an tsuiteála, osclófar an draoi socraithe. Cuir isteach an seoladh a"
" úsáideann tú chun rochtain a fháil ar do fhfreastalaí Nextcloud i "
"mbrabhsálaí, agus ansin cliceáil ar **Logáil isteach**."

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:74
msgid ""
"Server address field and Log in button in the desktop client setup wizard"
msgstr ""
"Réimse seoladh an fhreastalaí agus an cnaipe logála isteach san draoi "
"socraithe don chliant deisce"

#: ../../desktop/installation.rst:79
msgid ""
"For the remaining wizard steps, including browser authorization and sync "
"options, see :ref:`desktop-add-account`."
msgstr ""
"Maidir leis na céimeanna atá fágtha sa draoi, lena n-áirítear údarú "
"brabhsálaí agus roghanna sioncronaithe, féach :ref:`desktop-add-account`."
